  "contract": [
    "Eternal Magic 806698 reads 'Reduces the cooldown of Primordial Blast by 4 sec and it now refreshes 3 charges",
    "of Runeblade.' Elemental Mastery 806711 turns Primordial Blast into a random elemental version while its 6",
    "sec dummy aura is up: Ignis 713003 supersedes 800732 with 712668, so the cast the server runs is 712668",
    "(the same family flags as Primordial Blast). #7725 reports that the transformed cast no longer refreshes",
    "Runeblade. Runeblade 707141 has three charges with a six second recharge, so three normal casts empty it",
    "well inside the first recovery and the transformed cast must then hold three charges again. Riftblade 92154",
    "('Primordial Blast and Smolder refresh a charge of Runeblade') refreshes one charge instead of three, and",
    "without either aura the transformed cast refreshes nothing. A Runemaster without Elemental Mastery keeps an",
    "untransformed 800732. Learn, weapon, charge and aura steps are fixture setup."
  ],
